HEADLINE: Harbour Street Library Reopens After Nine-Week Renovation

- The renovated library replaced its leaking roof and moved the children's section to the ground floor.
- Seating rose to 60, and a free-to-book workshop room now hosts local groups.
- Extended hours on Tuesdays and Thursdays and earlier Saturday opening arrive, though the car park is closed until spring.

